<title>USA: ImmuDyne says settlement talks under way.</title>
<headline>ImmuDyne says settlement talks under way.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>ImmuDyne Inc said Tuesday that settlement discussions were under way regarding a shareholder lawsuit.</p>
<p>The lawsuit was filed in Texas.</p>
<p>The exact nature of the lawsuit was not disclosed. The biotechnology company said it was optimistic a settlement could be reached.</p>
</text>
